# Properties with an overlong name: the user is told the maximum (79), the name is
# cut to it, and the fields after it in memory must not be overwritten
# (Development Issues #75).
VERSION 13
DEMOINIT
ORIG 0.000 0.000 0.000
ROOMSIZE 40.000 x 20.000
SCALE HO
SENSOR 1 0 HO 2 5.000000 5.000000 "S1" "s1-script"
REDRAW
COMMAND Describe
MOUSE 2 5.000 5.000
MOUSE 4 5.000 5.000
PARAMETER Describe Sensor 1 NNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNN
PARAMETER Describe Sensor cancel
COMMAND Describe
MOUSE 2 5.000 5.000
MOUSE 4 5.000 5.000
PARAMCHECK Describe Sensor 1 NNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNN
PARAMCHECK Describe Sensor 2 5.000
PARAMCHECK Describe Sensor 4 s1-script
PARAMETER Describe Sensor cancel
